  "unit": "Possession (PNR ball-handler possession), with the immediately preceding offensive possession as the sequence.",
  "sample": "Regular seasons 2022-23 through 2024-25 (complete) and 2025-26 regular season from 2026-04-13 only. Exclude 2025-26 playoffs (partial before 2026-06-21). Include the pilot only after the initiation_type rebuild passes validation.",
  "power": "Compute the minimum detectable PPP difference before running the test; require at least the pre-registered number of DRIVE->PNR sequences per player-season, and report if the sequence count is below it.",
